@startuml client-submit-express-order

title client-submit-express-order v1 — trigger: client POSTs an order

legend right
  Participants match container-orders.puml v2 exactly.
  Timeouts nest: client 30s > intake 800ms > db 120ms.
endlegend

actor    "Submitting client" as client
participant "order-intake"    as intake
database    "orders-db"       as db
queue       "order-events"    as topic
participant "fulfilment-service" as fulfil

== Happy path ==

client -> intake : 1. POST /orders\nIdempotency-Key: <uuid>\nclient timeout 30s
activate intake

intake -> db : 2. SELECT by idempotency_key\ntimeout 50ms, no retry
activate db
db --> intake : 3. not found
deactivate db

intake -> db : 4. INSERT order + key (single txn, outbox row)\ntimeout 70ms, no retry
activate db
db --> intake : 5. committed — RPO 0 satisfied here
deactivate db

intake ->> topic : 6. publish order.accepted (from outbox)
intake --> client : 7. 202 Accepted\nLocation: /orders/{id}\nstatus: accepted
deactivate intake

note over client : Acknowledgement means ACCEPTED,\nnot fulfilled. Consistency point:\nstate durable at step 5.

topic ->> fulfil : 8. consume order.accepted (at-least-once)
activate fulfil
note right of fulfil : dedups on orderId —\nredelivery is expected, not exceptional
fulfil -> fulfil : 9. process
deactivate fulfil

== Failure: duplicate submission (QA-DATA-01) ==

client -> intake : POST /orders, same Idempotency-Key
activate intake
intake -> db : SELECT by idempotency_key
db --> intake : found, order {id}
intake --> client : 202 Accepted, Location: /orders/{id}\n(the original — no second order created)
deactivate intake

== Failure: database unavailable ==

client -> intake : POST /orders
activate intake
intake -> db : INSERT — timeout at 70ms
note right of intake : No acknowledgement is issued.\nNothing was written, so nothing is lost.
intake --> client : 503 Service Unavailable\nRetry-After: 5
deactivate intake
note over client : Client retries with the SAME key —\nthe retry is safe by construction.

== Failure: publish fails after commit ==

client -> intake : POST /orders
activate intake
intake -> db : INSERT order + outbox row (committed)
intake ->x topic : publish fails
intake --> client : 202 Accepted
deactivate intake
note over intake : Acceptance already durable.\nOutbox relay retries the publish with backoff.\nThis is why the outbox exists rather than a direct publish.

== Failure: fulfilment unavailable (QA-AVAIL-01) ==

topic ->x fulfil : consumer down
note over topic : Messages accumulate.\nAcceptance is unaffected — this is the point of ADR-0001.\nAlert on consumer lag > 5 min.

== Failure: poison message ==

topic ->> fulfil : consume order.accepted
activate fulfil
fulfil -> fulfil : processing fails, 3 attempts with backoff+jitter
fulfil ->> topic : send to DLQ after cap
deactivate fulfil
note right of fulfil : DLQ depth > 0 pages the Fulfilment team.\nRunbook: RB-014 drain procedure.

== Terminal states ==
' success        : 202 issued, order durable, event consumed
' partial        : 202 issued, event in DLQ — order accepted but not processed
' failure        : 503, nothing written
' timed-out      : client timeout at 30s; safe to retry with the same key

@enduml
